  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lahaina Fires - Good360 Longterm Recovery Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Good360 is working proactively with partners on projects to aid responders and survivors.   This includes a logistical cohort with LIFT Nonprofit Logistics, ALAN Aid, Airlink, Maersk, The UPS Foundation, to ensure efficient shipping of critical items We are setting up a shared warehouse space to receive, sort, and ship items for Maui. Also, Aloha Kits to help survivors get through the weeks ahead - kitchenware, household items, bedding AND a Volunteer Fire Safety Kit with appropriate PPE.</narrative>
  </description>
